# Local-dev settings for the agency gateway. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).

# The gateway holds no database and sends no email, but it still needs the shared
# key: it forwards client error beacons to auth's /internal/log-error. Without it
# a crash in somebody's browser never reaches error_logs. Must match auth /
# tenancy / content / mcp / the portal gateway exactly.
INTERNAL_KEY=
